es douleurs lombaires. 2. Le matelas trop dur\nBeaucoup de gens pensent qu\'il faut un matelas très dur pour ne pas avoir mal au dos. C\'est une erreur ! Un matelas trop dur ne respecte pas les formes de votre corps. Vos épaules et vos hanches ne s\'enfoncent pas, ce qui crée des points de pression.',NULL,'2026-04-13 08:49:17','2026-04-13 08:49:17','7a9d5cdf-1245-4449-8cbf-79ad4f94c08d','import',50,NULL,'cd0b2675322d7d2367fadc95b8e4eeef9da2023238423ccbd3b5d76ec73bf936'),('f3a5f78d-dffa-46a7-86a1-cbe79455d8cf',NULL,'ab45b07d-29fd-4262-9f8d-71e20831b714','6ca74e6d-3b5a-4b91-ad05-50f959c7796b','keywords: [\"matelas Supreme 5 Zones\"',NULL,'2026-04-16 10:10:59','2026-04-16 10:10:59','7a9d5cdf-1245-4449-8cbf-79ad4f94c08d','woocommerce',45,'{\"type\": \"statistical_alias\", \"field\": \"keywords\", \"value\": \"[\\\"matelas Supreme 5 Zones\\\"\", \"identifier\": \"Matelas NEW SUPREME 5 ZONES\", \"product_id\": \"6ca74e6d-3b5a-4b91-ad05-50f959c7796b\", \"product_index\": 32}','d81a5c76e915a19dbb3529667498d0e64e826a563522e9988d3dece6a2265187'),('f3bdcd75-17da-43db-b481-109057b98b40',NULL,'ab45b07d-29fd-4262-9f8d-71e20831b714','8ff3674d-cf9f-4a55-af34-d4bd9d345bbf','localisation',NULL,'2026-04-16 10:11:01','2026-04-16 10:11:01','7a9d5cdf-1245-4449-8cbf-79ad4f94c08d','woocommerce',35,'{\"type\": \"statistical_alias\", \"field\": \"language\", \"value\": \"fr\", \"identifier\": \"LIT BUBBLE\", \"product_id\": \"8ff3674d-cf9f-4a55-af34-d4bd9d345bbf\", \"product_index\": 33}','9975ee1f3492dcc03e0ddc04a08837d8975638dad258869f153e2b2cdbf6085f'),('f3c0a695-9dcc-42a3-9679-09429863b417',NULL,'ab45b07d-29fd-4262-9f8d-71e20831b714','621f8092-fd50-483f-b185-70b9e0b1ffe1','size',NULL,'2026-04-16 10:10:05','2026-04-16 10:10:05','7a9d5cdf-1245-4449-8cbf-79ad4f94c08d','woocommerce',35,'{\"type\": \"statistical_alias\", \"field\": \"dimensions\", \"value\": \"L199 * l146 * H106 (cm)\", \"identifier\": \"Lit Zen\", \"product_id\": \"621f8092-fd50-483f-b185-70b9e0b1ffe1\", \"product_index\": 2